In order to provide the advisory services , we need to obtain and retain information about you . Where you fail to provide this information, we will likely be unable to provide the requested advisory services .  Additionally, we retain the right to refuse to offer advisory services to you .
We are not tax advisers and therefore recommend that you take specialist tax advice.
For the purposes of the FCA rules, you will be categorised and treated as a retail client .  This means you will be given the highest levels of protection available, including access to the Financial Ombudsman Service (subject to their eligibility criteria).
We do not hold client money and therefore cannot receive it.  Please do not send us any funds for investment.
